From 990e4646f244f9e160e50957c7bf022f630e93f4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 01:15:43 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/5] lib/sgxfive: add the sgxfive transfer engine

Add the parts of libsgxfive the transfer tests need, as lib/sgxfive: the
ioctl layer, the builders and engine of the transfer recipes, and its
own assembled GPU programs, so the tests ship no closed bytes. All MIT,
and kept identical to the source by a sync script in sgxhumation. Spell
SGXFIVE_PAGE_SIZE in igt_sgxfive.h as it does, so both headers can be
included together.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Josep Torra <n770galaxy@gmail.com>
